PermitOpen 127.0.0.1:41045 127.0.0.1:41046 127.0.0.1:41047 127.0.0.1:41048 127.0.0.1:41049

PermitTTY no
PermitTunnel no
X11Forwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
GatewayPorts no
ForceCommand /bin/false

LogLevel VERBOSE
